  "answer": "The university attended by the CEO of the Chinese company (DeepSeek) that released the high-performing, low-cost large language model (DeepSeek-R1) in early 2025 is Zhejiang University, which was founded in **1897**.\n\n*   The DeepSeek-R1 model was released in January 2025, satisfying the condition of a \"high-performing, low-cost large language model in early 2025\" (E1, E2).\n*   Liang Wenfeng, the founder and CEO of DeepSeek, is a graduate of Zhejiang University (E9).\n*   The predecessor institution to Zhejiang University, Qiushi Academy, was established in 1897 (E10).",
